"xdg-base-directories`](../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-use-xdg-base-"
"directories) is enabled. [New Nix commands](../command-ref/new-cli/nix.md) "
"(experimental) use the proper directories by default."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/nix-copy-closure.md:451
